cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this claim store, please cite it as below."
title: "AD single-cell claim store"
abstract: >-
  Published conclusions of human post-mortem brain Alzheimer's disease single-nucleus studies, extracted as structured
  claims, re-tested donor-level across harmonised datasets (SEA-AD, PsychAD), rated for certainty, and served as an
  atlas, a knowledge graph and an MCP server. Built with the claimstore engine and template of the PD single-cell
  claim store (https://github.com/sergiomarco25/pd-sc-claims).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Marco Salas"
    given-names: "Sergio"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sergiomarco25/ad-sc-claims"
url: "https://sergiomarco25.github.io/ad-sc-claims/"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Alzheimer's disease
  - single-nucleus
  - replication
  - meta-analysis
  - knowledge graph
